&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We love pets - which is why we’re on a mission to make the world a better place for pets and their parents.&amp;nbsp; We offer pet insurance policies with generous pet health benefits that are designed with their needs in mind. We’ve helped half a million pets stay happy and healthy since 2017 - and many more customers throughout the world are joining us every day.&amp;nbsp; Our company is respectful, fun-loving and passionate about pets and their wellbeing.&amp;nbsp; Throughout our business you&#39;ll meet people who think differently, aim for impact, and love to try new things.&amp;nbsp; Want to join our pack?&amp;nbsp; Join us. Love every moment. Love ManyPets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;A day in the life&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Platform Engineer, you will join our platform squad. We build and maintain the AWS infrastructure, deployment pipelines, tooling and engineering standards that every other squad at ManyPets depends on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role has a security focus. Much of your first year will be spent building the tooling that lets us demonstrate our security controls are working: automated compliance checks, reporting, and evidence collection to support our ISO 27001 commitments. Alongside that you will help us tighten access controls across our cloud estate, and take on ownership of the edge and network security tooling that protects our services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also work closely with our Head of Security as we build out a dedicated security capability at ManyPets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our environment is fast-paced and highly collaborative. You will work closely with your teammates using pair or mob programming, participating in regular workshops and planning sessions, primarily over Zoom, with occasional in-person collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
